{"ticker":"BAC","updated":"2026-11-13T22:40:43Z","profile":{"longName":"Bank of America Corporation","shortName":"Bank of America Corporation","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Banks - Diversified","country":"United States","website":"https://www.bankofamerica.com","fullTimeEmployees":210000,"marketCap":352048676864,"trailingPE":12.176611,"forwardPE":9.849231,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.064624,"pegRatio":0.92,"targetMeanPrice":62.47727,"targetHighPrice":71.0,"targetLowPrice":56.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":22,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.034,"earningsGrowth":-0.125,"grossMargins":0.0,"operatingMargins":0.35306,"profitMargins":0.28064,"totalRevenue":114874998784,"beta":1.192,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":65.23,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":46.12,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.53},"summary":"Bank of America Corporation, through its subsidiaries, provides various financial products and services for individual consumers, small and middle-market businesses, institutional investors, large corporations, and governments worldwide. It operates through four segments: Consumer Banking, Global Wealth & Investment Management (GWIM), Global Banking, and Global Markets. The Consumer Banking segment offers traditional and money market savings accounts, certificates of deposit and IRAs, checking accounts, and investment accounts and products; credit and debit cards; residential mortgages and home equity loans; and direct and indirect loans. The GWIM segment provides investment management, brokerage, banking, and trust and retirement products and services; wealth management solutions; and customized solutions, including specialty asset management services. The Global Banking segment offers lending products and services, including commercial loans, leases, commitment facilities, trade finance, and commercial real estate and asset-based lending; treasury solutions, and underwriting and advisory services. The Global Markets segment provides market-making, financing, securities clearing, settlement, and custody services; securities and derivative products; and risk management products using interest rate, equity, credit, currency and commodity derivatives, foreign exchange, fixed-inco","summary_zh":"美國銀行公司透過其子公司為世界各地的個人消費者、中小型市場企業、機構投資者、大公司和政府提供各種金融產品和服務。它透過四個部門運作：消費者銀行業務、全球財富與投資管理（GWIM）、全球銀行業務和全球市場。消費者銀行業務部門提供傳統和貨幣市場儲蓄帳戶、存款證和個人退休帳戶、支票帳戶以及投資帳戶和產品；信用卡和金融卡；住宅抵押貸款和房屋淨值貸款；以及直接和間接貸款。 GWIM 部門提供投資管理、經紀、銀行、信託和退休產品及服務；財富管理解決方案；以及客製化解決方案，包括專業資產管理服務。全球銀行部門提供貸款產品和服務，包括商業貸款、租賃、承諾融資、貿易融資以及商業房地產和資產貸款；資金解決方案以及承銷和諮詢服務。全球市場部門提供做市、融資、證券清算、結算和託管服務；證券及衍生產品；使用利率、股票、信貸、貨幣和商品衍生品、外匯、固定收益的風險管理產品","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"銀行 - 多元化","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":50.85,"h":51.09,"l":50.46,"c":50.59,"v":29043600},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":50.64,"h":50.88,"l":50.21,"c":50.66,"v":31624400},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":50.86,"h":51.63,"l":50.79,"c":51.4,"v":38337900},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":51.49,"h":52.19,"l":51.3,"c":52.13,"v":35246900},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":52.15,"h":52.66,"l":51.76,"c":52.25,"v":98970700},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":51.76,"h":52.35,"l":51.76,"c":51.92,"v":27468000},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":52.0,"h":52.88,"l":51.52,"c":51.7,"v":28278200},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":51.85,"h":52.25,"l":51.46,"c":51.7,"v":27010400},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":51.48,"h":52.33,"l":51.44,"c":51.85,"v":22957900},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":52.11,"h":52.62,"l":51.98,"c":52.21,"v":20025800},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":52.36,"h":52.55,"l":52.11,"c":52.42,"v":23701000},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":52.48,"h":52.57,"l":51.02,"c":51.59,"v":29945000},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":51.3,"h":51.68,"l":50.56,"c":50.68,"v":27709100},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":50.65,"h":50.85,"l":50.07,"c":50.48,"v":22757200},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":50.62,"h":51.13,"l":50.55,"c":50.64,"v":24565700},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":50.93,"h":51.32,"l":49.89,"c":50.39,"v":25386300},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":50.55,"h":50.91,"l":50.13,"c":50.29,"v":24107300},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":50.4,"h":50.51,"l":49.78,"c":49.84,"v":24014200},{"t":"2